The build used by [[gw:Assassin|Assassin]] in the form of [[gw:Anton|Anton]] or [[gw:Nika|Nika]] in [[gw:Costume Brawl (2008)|Costume Brawl (2008)]].

==Skills and Attributes==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=a/any Dagger=14 shadow=11 crit=9 deadly=4][Hidden Caltrops][Death's Charge][Iron Palm][Falling Lotus Strike][Twisting Fangs][Black Spider Strike][Blades of Steel][Heart of Shadow][/build]
</pvxbig>

== Equipment ==
* [[gw:Bronze Daggers|Bronze Daggers]]
** Piercing Dmg: 7-17 (Requires 12 Dagger Mastery) 
** Damage +15% (while Health is above 50%) 
** Damage +20%

== Usage ==
* Snare foes and set up your chain with [[gw:Hidden Caltrops|Hidden Caltrops]].
* Use [[gw:Death's Charge|Death's Charge]] to get to your target quickly.
* Spike with [[gw:Iron Palm|Iron Palm]] → [[gw:Falling Lotus Strike|Falling Lotus Strike]] → [[gw:Twisting Fangs|Twisting Fangs]] → [[gw:Black Spider Strike|Black Spider Strike]] → [[gw:Blades of Steel|Blades of Steel]].
* Alternatively spike with [[gw:Black Spider Strike|Black Spider Strike]] → [[gw:Twisting Fangs|Twisting Fangs]] → [[gw:Iron Palm|Iron Palm]] → [[gw:Falling Lotus Strike|Falling Lotus Strike]] → [[gw:Blades of Steel|Blades of Steel]].
* Use [[gw:Heart of Shadow|Heart of Shadow]] as a self heal and to get away from enemies.

